{"ts":"2026-07-26T22:34:43.941Z","author":"harness:opencode","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"opencode","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-0d7ord"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Render-ready workspace export and reference dashboard package: bounded graph slices, flow metrics, and milestone ladders consumable by any visualization stack without scraping CLI text"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Far-horizon feature. Agents read pm output directly; humans need pictures. Define a versioned render-ready projection (SDK-first): bounded subgraph slices with typed edges, flow-metric series from pm-pee5, milestone-ladder progress, and fleet attribution from pm-gw6uyq, emitted as documented JSON/NDJSON streams (pm-mav1ak). Ship a reference pm-dashboard package that renders it as a static site; any other stack (Grafana, Observable, custom web UI) consumes the same projection. No daemon: the projection is a read-side materialization on the derived read index (pm-801d). Horizon: far, after the read index and flow metrics land."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Feature"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":3},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["area:sdk","context-management","dashboard","export","horizon:far","package","visualization"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-26T22:34:43.941Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-26T22:34:43.941Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:opencode"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-ugqx"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"b025c4babbbebd37b929abb7fd6464d565e9a6d68fe338e2aeb24adf549aa2c6","message":""}
